        "7448fed2-4aeb-42f6-947c-c3f49f46778b": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Mary Rand",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>So, almost everything is my favorite product and daily driver. I use the Vertical Wallet with a Wrist Lanyard to hold all my cards, I put my car keys on the Neck Lanyard. I put all of that in the Fanny Pack and wear it as a cross body, and then I use the Tote for bigger stuff like my computer, water bottle, sweatshirt, & farmers market goods. I basically don’t leave the house without all of the above.<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On means to practicing the ability to move through life with connection, compassion, confidence & clarity given the different obstacles that we all face. Key word there is practice.<\/p><h6><\/h6><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/bigairmare\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/bigairmare\/\">@bigairmare<\/a><\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image0_1.jpg",
            "button_label": "Button",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
            "color_text": "color__text",
            "color_button": "btn",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-end",
