          }
        },
        "00663d99-ddbb-4ba0-908e-6b2473297a46": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ethan Jones",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>My favorite Thread product would be the Crossbody Bag, perfect for being a photographer and always on the go. It’s nice to have an effortless way to carry extra film & a small camera.<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Surfing and Running! I believe it’s so important to have a good work-life balance. Getting out in the water or out for a run really keeps me sane, that’s how I Carry On!<\/p><h6><\/h6><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/ethanjones.co\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/ethanjones.co\/\">@ethanjones.co<\/a><\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/SP002246-25A_5964ff10-b338-41ca-8209-ef8cafdb045a.jpg",
            "button_label": "Button",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
            "color_text": "color__text",
            "color_button": "btn",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-end",
            "layout_x_alignment": "",
            "layout_desktop_width": 3,
            "layout_mobile_width": 8,
            "enable_padding": true
          }
        },
        "8fd9c3da-f36b-499f-a110-c28c3f1f2ec8": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ivy Miller",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>I love the Mini Backpack, I can fit just about everything in it. I've taken it on the plane and to events. It's so versatile & perfect for everything!<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On means to accept the roller-coaster of good and bad, light and dark, fun and boring, learning and celebrating—polarity of life. To not get fixated on one emotion for too long because that's the beauty of life: it changes and that's growing. Thread has made me feel confident in knowing I have community besides me. Regardless of the current hole or mountain I'm dealing with internally, I know I can turn to my friends and family at Thread and lean on them in any state.<\/p><h6><\/h6><p><a href=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/ivuss\/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https:\/\/www.instagram.com\/ivuss\/\">@ivuss<\/a><\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image0_1_25566dfc-d1ca-4d74-be7e-3a406f1acd1c.jpg",
            "button_label": "Button",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
            "color_text": "color__text",
            "color_button": "btn btn--secondary",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-end",
            "layout_x_alignment": "",
            "layout_desktop_width": 3,
