        "5d6e0917-13c7-41a0-b495-9c021656f460": {
          "type": "content",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Kelis Kaleopa'a",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>My favorite Thread product is the Fanny Pack; I catch myself using it the most just because it is so useful, cute, and practical. It holds all my goodies: phone, wallet, keys, lip gloss, and protein bars.<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On is exactly what it stands for—carrying about mental health. Being a part of a company that puts mental health first has been amazing and helped my own well being a lot. To Carry On is to surround yourself with the ones you love and doing what you love.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/Screenshot_2023-10-16_at_2.29.14_PM.png",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
            "color_text": "color__text",
            "color_button": "btn btn--secondary",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-end",
            "layout_x_alignment": "",
            "layout_desktop_width": 3,
            "layout_mobile_width": 8,
            "enable_padding": true
          }
        },
        "4d754c88-56c0-4fe8-b06e-164542aeea85": {
          "type": "content",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Nate Miceli",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>My favorite Thread product is the Bifold. I'm a big fan of the traditional wallet style, but they were always way too bulky to keep on me while skiing. The Bifold fits everything I need while allowing me to forget I even have it.<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On to me means to keep pushing in whatever it is you're doing. Don't get caught up in the small stuff. Live in the moment and trust you'll be able to find your way.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/image002.jpg",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
            "color_text": "color__text",
            "color_button": "btn btn--secondary",
            "enable_gradient": false,
            "layout_y_alignment": "items-end",
            "layout_x_alignment": "",
            "layout_desktop_width": 3,
            "layout_mobile_width": 8,
            "enable_padding": true
          }
        },
        "97166e97-54e9-4f3e-a076-2861220a83cd": {
          "type": "content",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Poe Pinson",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>My favorite Thread product is the Crossbody Bag because they help me stay organized and keep track of my items in style<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On to me is a reminder to always view the world in the most positive way I can. Throughout any hardship or challenge there is a light at the end of the tunnel. It helps me remember how important mental health is, and to treat yourself and those around you with kindness and love because you never know what somebody might be struggling with.<\/p>",
            "image_featured": "shopify:\/\/shop_images\/MC5A5946.jpg",
            "button_label": "",
            "button_url": "",
            "spacing_top": 0,
            "spacing_bottom": 0,
            "color_scheme": "color__bg-body color__text",
            "color_border": "color__border-divider-1",
