        "3ece06e5-7747-4aaa-a4d5-0135b20f7c64": {
          "type": "content",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Rex Hennings",
            "content": "<h6><em>Favorite product and why:<\/em><\/h6><p>My favorite Thread product is the Elastic Wallet. I love it because I can keep my car keys with my cards at all times. I love having my keys look sick with a super cool wallet<\/p><h6><\/h6><h6><em>What does Carry On mean to you:<\/em> <\/h6><p>Carry On means to move forward with great attitude. It may seem like it's hard to keep a good attitude, but you have to remember to Carry On.<\/p>",
